ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/7dfba799b6b61db04ba9dce77547f88d.webp?t=1744527812\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/27d9e30d844b51a7f2c7bd661623bc19.avif?t=1744527812\" /></span>At launch, Conquest of Eldinar will feature online 1v1 or 2v2 multiplayer battles where you can prove your mettle against real foes. Choose your faction and join online matchmaking to engage in thrilling matches against other players, whether in casual or competitive ranked games. Climb to the top of your faction's leaderboards and assert your supremacy as your faction's representative in the worldwide battle for dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/b004f45156d3dc574a87834132b354ec.poster.avif?t=1744527812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/b004f45156d3dc574a87834132b354ec.webm?t=1744527812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/b004f45156d3dc574a87834132b354ec.mp4?t=1744527812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/7dfba799b6b61db04ba9dce77547f88d.webp?t=1744527812\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/7931f255292df60a1228885febb03b78.avif?t=1744527812\" /></span>The game will offer a diverse range of unlockable content for your profile, such as new character skins, profile icons, emotes, placeable banners, and more. You can acquire these items using in-game currency obtained through victorious battles in singleplayer or multiplayer modes. These unlockable items can be used in both modes of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/bd99e0f53d6dba468b8ebcaa11222705.poster.avif?t=1744527812\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/bd99e0f53d6dba468b8ebcaa11222705.webm?t=1744527812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/bd99e0f53d6dba468b8ebcaa11222705.mp4?t=1744527812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548280/extras/7dfba799b6b61db04ba9dce77547f88d.webp?t=1744527812\" /></span></p>",
