        "notes": "Conquest of Eldinar does depict stylized fantasy violence while in combat. Units on the battlefield can be dismembered and slain producing a variety of blood effects like splatters and pools of blood on the ground. All of these graphics options will be toggle-able in the in-game menus so no, blood is not mandatory. However visceral action combat with weapons such as swords or guns will always be a core element of the game."
